A glossy red icon in the [[frutiger-aero|Frutiger Aero]] style, with a soft gradient fill and a thick rounded outline. OpenDB uses it on the `{{disputed}}` and `{{outdated}}` templates, for entries whose facts may be wrong or out of date. A smaller copy is used on the site itself.
